  "description": {
    "html": "<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\">Make a sophisticated statement with this black embroidered kurta set. Featuring elegant embroidery on a mandarin-collar kurta, this outfit is paired with matching palazzo pants for exceptional comfort and effortless style. Ideal for evening celebrations, festive occasions, and wedding festivities, it delivers a refined ethnic look with modern appeal.</div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\">Key Features</div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\">Elegant embroidered craftsmanship</div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\">Classic mandarin collar</div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\">Comfortable regular-fit silhouette</div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\">Full sleeves for a polished finish</div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\">Matching palazzo pants included</div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\">Lightweight construction for extended comfort</div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\">Perfect for festive evenings, receptions, and celebrations</div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\">Styling Tips</div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\">Pair with black embroidered mojaris for a sophisticated finish.</div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\">Add a metallic watch for a premium touch.</div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\">Complete the look with a contrasting stole for grand occasions.</div>",
